      "what_is_needed_instead": "A board-approved risk data governance framework, including: data quality risk appetite, accountable senior ownership (Chief Data Officer or equivalent), a data governance committee with board reporting, agreed SLAs for risk data processes (¶27), and a documented process for informing the board of aggregation limitations (¶30-31). These governance structures authorise and give meaning to the catalog's contents, but the catalog does not create them.",
